The Rust, Python and TypeScript implementation in this project is newly written
for an independent MVP. It is not an official release, a full translation, an
upstream-compatible replacement, or a claim of endorsement by wayyoungboy.
The original Go/Vue implementation is not redistributed in this deliverable.
The original license text is the copied upstream artifact. Design concepts and
module responsibilities informed this implementation; the differences and
unported capabilities are recorded in docs/UPSTREAM.md.

Upstream's README credits seeksky/golutra for design inspiration. This project
preserves that acknowledgment; no golutra source was copied into this MVP.

